Subject: [PATCH 4/8] v5 Add mutex for add/remove of memory blocks
References: <4C60407C.2080608@austin.ibm.com>
In-Reply-To: <4C60407C.2080608@austin.ibm.com>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=ISO-8859-1
